Maintainer: Julius Arkenberg <julius@rkenberg.de>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/arki05/pve-meta-traefik

Package: pve-meta-traefik
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Traefik HTTP provider endpoint fed from pve-meta guest metadata
 Serves a Traefik dynamic configuration document assembled from the guests
 of a Proxmox VE cluster: every running guest whose pve-meta document has a
 `traefik` subtree contributes it, with the guest's address filled in from
 the cluster (container interfaces, the guest agent, or an IP tag). Traefik
 polls it through its built-in HTTP provider; nothing is installed in
 Traefik itself.
